Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.09,0:00:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(飞夫)谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“速攻魔法 献身的爱。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束战斗，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合结束时，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的生命值变为0”。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊？这张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的生命值都变成0了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那用了不就没意义了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.03,0:00:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海美)安娜酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海美姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算现在还不明白{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡的含义，总有一天会明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎光临～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:00:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请问要点些什么呢～？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(收银员/小鸟)欢迎光临！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.87,0:01:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎来到怪兽咖啡厅！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)这是菜单。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请抽选您所点的商品。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.71,0:01:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……就这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.66,0:01:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汉堡……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哟，小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说有学园祭我就来玩啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.05,0:01:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……啊啊，安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.23,0:01:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等，这要怎么办啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.17,0:01:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乱成一团了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在搞什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.26,0:01:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？那身打扮是。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太鼓魔人 咚咚天蓬哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这也太合适了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.65,0:01:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法啊猜拳输掉了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）不过我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:01:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺可爱的，挺好的呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的游马好想尽情宠爱猫咪啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)游马 我也
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}觉得非常合适就是了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)大新闻！ 大新闻！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马同学 大新闻！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}情侣决斗大会？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.37,0:02:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}学园主办的那场大会里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为嘉宾 职业决斗者羽原飞夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海美夫妻来了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)说到飞夫 海美夫妻{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在双人决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.33,0:02:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发挥出无与伦比实力的著名组合。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可不能坐视不管啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和职业决斗者双人决斗吗 燃起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.17,0:02:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}参加大会的情侣只要有意愿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像就能和那两人对战哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听说海美选手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最近要放弃决斗了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以就拿这个当粉丝福利……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么回事啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.45,0:02:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说要放弃决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:02:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，安娜……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就……就算你问我……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《怎么会……海美姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要放弃决斗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马跟我一起参加情侣决斗大会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎，跟我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马要跟你一起情侣决斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}问我为什么，那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之我必须得出场才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）就是啊，不行的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马要和我一起出场！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啥，为什么会变成这样！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之我要和游马组成搭档！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那也不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.68,0:03:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小静）打扰你们正忙的时候不好意思……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（幸）小鸟和凯西小姐先不说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你应该是没法参加
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搭档决斗大会的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为……为什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为如果不是我们学园的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就不能参加。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……骗人的吧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)啊啊 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直 一直倾慕着您。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论是冰冷的雨天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是冻结的雪天。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 公主啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}演得真够恶心的。简直看不下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)好了好了哥哥大人 冷静一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？ 什… 什么啊 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)我是魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.11,0:06:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 哦 哥哥大人这称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可轮不到你叫！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.67,0:06:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)吵死～了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.27,0:06:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是不能安静地看就出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(爱华)话说感觉有点生硬呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过呢……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}花是映照心灵的镜子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种一本正经的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我并不讨厌哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 哈…… 哈～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.83,0:06:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(太一)啊哈哈 太棒了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝶野沙奈木酱的演唱会门票
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到手啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)用换来的黄牛票
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然收集到了这么多稀有卡，乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.24,0:06:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世上被骗的笨蛋可真多啊，乌拉～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:06:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(沙奈木)给我吐出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(神宫寺)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你最近挺风光啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)学、学生会会长！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我听听详细情况吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟……糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊。把我叫到这种地方来。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人独处的时候注意你的措辞。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是巴利安警察的警部{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而你是平巡查。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是！ 失礼了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马巡查，像学园祭这种时候需要加强警戒。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从外面会有什么样的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混进来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁也说不准。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 又是巴利安！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.53,0:07:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有这个可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 为了以防万一实施校内巡逻。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}了解。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果发现巴利安的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用你…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用警部大人赐予的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡来反击。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很期待哦 游马巡查。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)小鸟 抱歉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是不想做这种事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我今天要参加情侣决斗大会{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何都有想确认的事情。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「认真决胜负 生命值」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「还差一点」 上咯～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「心之决斗 心之决斗」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「向我施下 恋爱陷阱卡」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「心之决斗 心之决斗」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夏克大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「用炽热的指尖 抽卡吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)好嘞好嘞 蛹 召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大阪烧 好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:08:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}章鱼烧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炒面！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.26,0:09:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄油土豆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巧克力香蕉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杏子糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃～接下来吃什么呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君，我想你应该明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们可不是来玩的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦，对哦对哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.21,0:09:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你刚才吃的大阪烧和章鱼烧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么区别？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？区别啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}章鱼烧里面有章鱼……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大阪烧里面是放了大阪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（安娜）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜，你这身打扮！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.45,0:09:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼哼，这样一来我也是这所学园的学生了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 无论如何我都要你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我进行情侣决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.64,0:09:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是敢说不 我就这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知 知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:10:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和学生决斗什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得有点紧张啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.03,0:10:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以绝妙组合引以为傲的双人组。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊？ 你这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用来对付那家伙再合适不过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的力量就让我拿来用用吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 差不多到时间了我的甜心。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身体不舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有 我没事。没什么的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！穿上我的制服冒充学生…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算去参加情侣决斗大会喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)怎么能让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]不愧是职业选手！转眼之间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就把3组挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给打败了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克风]那么 下一位挑战者是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)等等 等等～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一位挑战者！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 安娜酱…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你认识她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那孩子来过婚礼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海美)嗯 神月安娜酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我教她决斗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]哦哦 这可不得了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]WDC的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马选手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和神秘少女一起乱入啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜酱 真是吓我一跳。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜酱的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然是WDC的冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是安娜的男朋友！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事 怎样都无所谓！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海美姐！ 你说不玩决斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明你说过就算结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算变成老婆婆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也绝对不会放弃决斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海美姐你这个骗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是的 不是那样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}借口什么的 我不想听！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海美姐之前就说过了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我 在决斗中赢了姐姐{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么事都要听我一个要求。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我 在这场决斗中赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让她别再放弃决斗了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜酱…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的你 不管说什么看来都是白费呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧 这场决斗 我接受了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 你们两人之间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}似乎有什么误会啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 决斗就再合适不过了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要通过决斗碰撞交锋{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么样的误解都能一扫而空！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Boy 不愧是决斗狂欢节的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冠军啊 好孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[扬声器]AR视野 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻 我拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 果然！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～！ 好不甘心！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《各玩家的生命值 各自4000。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方玩家两人都打倒的一方获胜。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先 要看对方怎么出招…》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冰堡·海洋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:13:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是 将场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}表侧守备表示怪兽的守备力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.32,0:14:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈妮 这个就当作我送给你的礼物吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 发动魔法卡 气球派对！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤２只气球衍生物。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将２只怪兽解放
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级10的超巨大飞行艇{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨神飞艇堡升级召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好、好厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.88,0:14:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你感叹个什么劲啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在标签决斗中，所有玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在第一回合都不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放１张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，我的回合。抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤哥哥哥哥雷姆。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，这里还是巩固防守
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.25,0:15:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看看对方的动向比较好。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放２张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 飞艇派对。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以特殊召唤２只飞艇衍生物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将２只怪兽解放，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行上级召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.48,0:15:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，超巨大不沉客船优雅泰坦尼克。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又出来了个超厉害的家伙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别高兴得太早啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动巨神兵的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.41,0:15:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级５以上的怪兽被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的等级９以下的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上，场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冰堡·海洋的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的表侧守备表示
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的守备力变为零。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰轰轰——魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时，发动优雅泰坦尼克的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１回合１次，将场上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.21,0:16:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１只守备力为零的怪兽破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个攻击力的一半伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你这家伙 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么被人打成这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！ 我这边也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又不是自愿被打的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是所谓职业级的配合吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动陷阱卡 复活拼图。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在自己的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被卡的效果破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.41,0:16:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将被破坏的怪兽以攻击表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来吧 隆隆隆隆隆魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挺有一套的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:16:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等这一刻等好久了 我的回合。 抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 深夜急行骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夜快车骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙通过将攻击力变为零
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用解放就能召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一发！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 扎赞克罗斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只的等级变成10。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轰轰轰轰——魔像 等级提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～ 我的轰轰轰轰——魔像变成等级10了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕这就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级10的夜行特快骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和轰轰轰轰——魔像进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从铁道的彼方伴随着地鸣 现在抵达。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 超重型炮塔列车！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.32,0:18:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古斯塔夫·马克斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！ 为什么我的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被你随便拿去用了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.73,0:18:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照这次大会的规则
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用搭档的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:21.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来召唤艾克西斯也是可以的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话虽如此……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}行了 你闭嘴 在旁边看着就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古斯塔夫·马克斯的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙通过消耗1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手造成2000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)目标是 海美姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发射吧！ 大加农炮！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 engagement destiny 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让搭档受到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的一半伤害由自己承受。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海美！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《飞夫：我们两人悲伤减半 喜悦加倍》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《海美：嗯 不管什么样的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要两人一起分担就不会痛苦》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵～ 好棒～。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.34,0:19:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好令人憧憬啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Honey。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Darling。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖下一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上了。我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}My Honey是时候展现两人爱的结晶了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的 Darling。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级10的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:20:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨型希登堡号和优雅泰坦尼克号{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.55,0:20:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.49,0:20:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当翱翔天际的勇者与海洋王女结为连理之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宏大世界的奇迹将绽放。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(飞夫)超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 超巨大空中宫殿 冈加里迪亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超巨大空中宫殿 刚加利亚的\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚加利亚通过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.09,0:21:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那名玩家的生命值减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目标 古斯塔夫·马克斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧！泰坦尼克俯冲！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我的古斯塔夫·马克斯…》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}何等强力的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.21,0:21:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少年 接下来轮到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚加利亚 对九十九游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.20,0:23:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.11,0:23:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.36,0:23:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.07,0:23:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.73,0:23:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
